@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:build] browser-offline-tools
Browser builds and checks MUST use the locked hash-verified npm input with
install scripts disabled and no network access during the ordinary build.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:security] browser-download-package
The installed bin directory MUST contain only chrome.zip and firefox.xpi;
manifest.json MUST describe their SHA-256 digests, lengths and unsigned status.
Unpacked extension assets MUST remain in a separate share directory.
